{"data": [{"author_id": "1699516657922613248", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:13:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116277221929197702"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "ow.ly/Mxai106HyzR", "end": 125, "expanded_url": "https://ow.ly/Mxai106HyzR", "start": 102, "unwound_url": "https://insideaipolicy.com/ai-daily-news/roundup-letters-house-senate-democrats-offer-pre-election-glimpses-frontier-ai", "url": "https://t.co/vrZkwLlpYs"}]}, "id": "2116277221929197702", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 54, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Roundup: Letters from House, Senate Democrats offer pre-election glimpses into frontier AI priorities https://t.co/vrZkwLlpYs", "url": "https://x.com/InsideAIPolicy/status/2116277221929197702"}, {"author_id": "1976885052215603200", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:01:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116274282007584953"], "entities": {"hashtags": [{"end": 218, "start": 205, "tag": "EnterpriseAI"}, {"end": 223, "start": 219, "tag": "GCC"}], "urls": [{"description": "/PRNewswire/ -- Cognizant (Nasdaq: CTSH) today announced the formation of its OpenAI Frontier Capability Group, bringing together more than 25,000...", "display_url": "prnewswire.com/news-releases/…", "end": 247, "expanded_url": "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/cognizant-commits-more-than-25-000-professionals-to-openai-delivery-as-enterprises-move-frontier-ai-into-production-302924550.html", "images": [{"height": 361, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116111151394332672/b37kewk9?format=jpg&name=orig", "width": 1199}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2116111151394332672/b37kewk9?format=jpg&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 224, "status": 200, "title": "Cognizant commits more than 25,000 professionals to OpenAI delivery as enterprises move frontier AI into production", "unwound_url": "https://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/cognizant-commits-more-than-25-000-professionals-to-openai-delivery-as-enterprises-move-frontier-ai-into-production-302924550.html", "url": "https://t.co/DvNbPGjYHO"}]}, "id": "2116274282007584953", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 32, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Cognizant commits 25,000+ people to deliver OpenAI Codex and ChatGPT for enterprises. GCC operators: expect frontier AI deals through IT services partners. Local vendors need integrator partnerships too.\n\n#EnterpriseAI #GCC\nhttps://t.co/DvNbPGjYHO", "url": "https://x.com/raqi_ai_uae/status/2116274282007584953"}, {"author_id": "15876871", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:26:50.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116280694553117121"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/5s71uyTfYa", "end": 285, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/BenjaminTseng/status/2116280694553117121/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116277859023220736", "start": 262, "url": "https://t.co/5s71uyTfYa"}]}, "id": "2116280694553117121", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 45, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Frontier AI models score &gt;90% on medical board exams. But when researchers asked AI to actually make care plans for real (primary care and ER) patient encounters, their test &amp; referral recommendations cost 3.2x more\n\nThe hidden economics of AI medicine 🧵 https://t.co/5s71uyTfYa", "url": "https://x.com/BenjaminTseng/status/2116280694553117121"}, {"author_id": "1519346231272685568", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:40:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116284190060576869"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/demishassabis/…", "end": 301, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/demishassabis/status/2076957440109625718", "start": 278, "url": "https://t.co/AintFdKROa"}]}, "id": "2116284190060576869", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2076957440109625718", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "1/4 Who should test the most powerful AI before it reaches us? In July, Dr Demis Hassabis of Google DeepMind proposed a US \"Frontier AI Standards Body\", modelled on FINRA, the industry-funded body that polices Wall Street brokers. Here is his plan, and what has happened since. https://t.co/AintFdKROa", "url": "https://x.com/HasanASaleem/status/2116284190060576869"}, {"author_id": "2082469612676079616", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:07:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116275945027858536"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/kSQhnRqZ3g", "end": 302, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/AIBoticssq/status/2116275945027858536/video/1", "media_key": "13_2116275858948116480", "start": 279, "url": "https://t.co/kSQhnRqZ3g"}]}, "id": "2116275945027858536", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 19, "impression_count": 3399, "like_count": 27, "quote_count": 2, "reply_count": 15, "retweet_count": 6}, "text": "🚨 THE AI BOOM IS CANNIBALIZING the rest of the tech industry and Intel just paid the ultimate price\n\nIntel stock suffered a historic 30% crash in a single session, marking its steepest market collapse since 1974\n\nThe paradox is wild because Intel AI data center revenue actually https://t.co/kSQhnRqZ3g", "url": "https://x.com/AIBoticssq/status/2116275945027858536"}, {"author_id": "1879047557227094016", "created_at": "2026-10-30T20:56:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116273176925683992"], "id": "2116273176925683992", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "What happens when 70+ frontier AI models operate through one intelligent infrastructure layer? Something bigger than just AI access. \n\nAs the AI ecosystem expands, developers face a growing challenge: working across different models, managing usage, coordinating requests, and", "url": "https://x.com/MrOracleaxiom/status/2116273176925683992"}, {"author_id": "15528707", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:13:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116277316682764504"], "id": "2116277316682764504", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 10, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Helping founders, investors and the tech industry turn complex EU rules — from the AI Act to platform liability — into clear, practical guidance.\n\nBc responsible innovation needs + than compliance. It needs sound judgement, strategy and an understanding of where tech is heading.", "url": "https://x.com/jmperezmarzabal/status/2116277316682764504"}, {"author_id": "43690907", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:12:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116276996510511271"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 265, "id": "1017500185356853248", "start": 250, "username": "SenBillCassidy"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/wGdxaLnKBe", "end": 289, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/Kennyperez/status/2116276996510511271/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2116276927673638912", "start": 266, "url": "https://t.co/wGdxaLnKBe"}]}, "id": "2116276996510511271", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 79, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Sen. Bill Cassidy released a draft PATIENT AI Act that would clarify FDA vs. ONC oversight of healthcare AI and create a federal payment pathway for AI services, with HHS building a coverage framework and CMMI testing payment for autonomous AI care. @SenBillCassidy https://t.co/wGdxaLnKBe", "url": "https://x.com/Kennyperez/status/2116276996510511271"}, {"author_id": "372138629", "created_at": "2026-10-30T21:17:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2116278435421003954"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 15, "id": "4398626122", "start": 8, "username": "OpenAI"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/p2j6sz849r", "end": 297, "expanded_url": "https: